                            <i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff-fill fs-3"></i> Interests
                        </h4>
                        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                            <li class="list-group-item d-flex align-items-center gap-3">Cloud &amp; Parallel Computing</li>
                            <li class="list-group-item d-flex align-items-center gap-3">Big Data Analysis and Management</li>
                            <li class="list-group-item d-flex align-items-center gap-3">High-performance and Low-Power Real-Time Systems</li>
                            <li class="list-group-item d-flex align-items-center gap-3">Mobile Embedded Systems and Network Security</li>
